quantidades diferentes destas peças.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.poster.avif?t=1786216565\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.webm?t=1786216565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.mp4?t=1786216565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.poster.avif?t=1786216565\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.webm?t=1786216565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.mp4?t=1786216565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
